Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:11:41 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Reconnect dropped STT provider sockets with backoff

Wrap both providers in a withReconnect decorator composed inside
withIdleTimeout: unexpected close/error retries up to 5 times with
exponential backoff and full jitter, buffers audio across the gap, and
surfaces SttReconnectError only after retries exhaust. Manager rebases
streamBaseS on the new onReconnect event and forwards error codes.
